      "name": "ai_prompt",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "This is an Indian Form 16 (TDS certificate on salary) for FY 2025-26. Read it and answer ONLY a JSON object with these keys, numbers in rupees without commas (0 when absent): employer (name), tan, gross_17_1 (salary u/s 17(1)), perq_17_2, profit_17_3, lta (10(5)), gratuity (10(10)), commuted (10(10A)), leave (10(10AA)), hra (10(13A)), exempt_other, exempt_total (total exempt u/s 10), std (16(ia)), prof_tax (16(iii)), c80c, c80ccc, c80ccd1, c80ccd1b, c80ccd2, c80d_self (80D), c80d_parents, c80e, c80g (deductible amounts), tds (total tax deducted in Part A). Never guess a figure that is not printed.",
